Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:29,150
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,210
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,080
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,390
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,190
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,860
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,910
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:02,710
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 12=

12
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,680
(At midnight,)

13
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:20,680
(comb your hair before the mirror)

14
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,230
(and chant:)

15
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,280
(First comb, reach the netherworld.)

16
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,150
Second comb, the ghost paints its skin.

17
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:30,350
Third comb, a wish becomes a prophecy.

18
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:34,280
Fourth comb, steal heaven's will.

19
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:45,000
You're awake?

20
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,040
What are you doing?

21
00:01:46,790 --> 00:01:48,150
I'm luring the demon out.

22
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,230
It's none of your business.

23
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,430
What's that demon got to do with you?

24
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:53,680
Why must you lure her out?

25
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,480
You said it yourself. Whether I live
or die is none of your concern.

26
00:01:57,100 --> 00:01:59,120
Then why did you have Shiqi
protect me in secret?

27
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:03,840
Song Ziyuan,

28
00:02:04,460 --> 00:02:05,510
you care a lot about me.

29
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,310
Enough with such nonsense.

30
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,150
I don't understand.

31
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,310
You clearly care about me,

32
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,120
yet you act like you despise me.

33
00:02:16,810 --> 00:02:17,449
You risk your life

34
00:02:17,491 --> 00:02:19,030
to save me again and again,

35
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,630
only to push me away again and again.

36
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,430
Song Ziyuan,

37
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:24,840
what exactly are you hiding?

38
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:26,800
Do you really not remember

39
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:28,400
what happened in our past life?

40
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:31,120
There's no such thing as a past life.

41
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:33,360
I don't know what you're talking about.

42
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:36,310
Then let me see

43
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,960
what's on your mind.

44
00:02:40,810 --> 00:02:41,910
You're using your blood

45
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,360
as lamp oil again?

46
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,360
How else would I save your life?

47
00:02:47,090 --> 00:02:48,150
I don't need you to save me.

48
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,630
How much blood do you have
to burn as lamp oil?

49
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:53,460
Are you going to

50
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,490
stay by my side forever,

51
00:02:55,930 --> 00:02:57,090
using your blood to keep me alive

52
00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:58,300
for the rest of your life?

53
00:03:00,210 --> 00:03:00,980
So...

54
00:03:02,300 --> 00:03:03,460
that's why.

55
00:03:05,490 --> 00:03:06,900
You're afraid of putting me in danger,

56
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:08,900
afraid I'll keep using my blood

57
00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:10,050
to protect your soul.

58
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:12,210
That's why you tried to drive me away,
isn't it?

59
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:15,860
Don't flatter yourself.

60
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:20,460
Song Ziyuan,

61
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:23,460
just how much do you like me?

62
00:03:27,370 --> 00:03:28,700
I don't like you.

63
00:03:28,810 --> 00:03:29,580
I don't believe you.

64
00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:38,740
You're not welcome here.

65
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,610
Leave.

66
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:43,700
I think

67
00:03:43,930 --> 00:03:44,810
I'm quite welcome.

68
00:03:46,210 --> 00:03:47,530
I'm staying here tonight.

69
00:03:47,810 --> 00:03:48,980
Saves Shiqi the trouble of
running back and forth.

70
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:49,860
That's such a hassle.

71
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,530
I'm tired. I'm going to sleep.

72
00:03:54,020 --> 00:03:54,530
What,

73
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:55,650
you want to sleep with me?

74
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,650
It's just a little blood.

75
00:04:04,490 --> 00:04:05,420
I'm not even afraid.

76
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:06,860
So why are you scared?

77
00:04:09,370 --> 00:04:10,420
You're so difficult.

78
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:16,860
(Song Residence)

79
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:18,020
I'm looking for Chu Li.

80
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:19,020
Don't stop me.

81
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:20,820
The Diviner's residence

82
00:04:21,060 --> 00:04:22,460
isn't a place you can just walk in.

83
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:23,410
Get out.

84
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:25,210
Do you know how long I've lived here?

85
00:04:25,380 --> 00:04:26,380
Don't play dumb with me.

86
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:33,060
Chu Li!

87
00:04:34,970 --> 00:04:36,770
Why did you suddenly come back?

88
00:04:37,090 --> 00:04:38,140
And you didn't even tell me.

89
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:38,970
Oh, right.

90
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:41,260
I actually forgot about you.

91
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:44,410
You don't care about me at all.

92
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:48,140
Don't be so dramatic.

93
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:49,850
It's fine.

94
00:04:49,970 --> 00:04:50,970
I'm not angry at all.

95
00:04:54,410 --> 00:04:55,090
However,

96
00:04:55,380 --> 00:04:56,439
why did you suddenly come back

97
00:04:56,481 --> 00:04:57,500
to Diviner Song's place?

98
00:04:58,060 --> 00:04:59,770
Are you done with your business?
Let's go then.

99
00:05:01,140 --> 00:05:01,900
I'm not leaving.

100
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,650
It's nice here. And everything's free.

101
00:05:05,850 --> 00:05:06,770
It's a nice place to stay.

102
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,650
But...

103
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:09,620
Did you and Diviner Song make up?

104
00:05:10,210 --> 00:05:11,580
He can't get rid of me anyway.

105
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:12,770
Then I'm not leaving either.

106
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:16,260
Someone has to keep you company.

107
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:17,580
Otherwise...

108
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:19,410
If Diviner Song ever gives you grief,

109
00:05:20,210 --> 00:05:22,090
you'll need someone to talk to.

110
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,020
You've got some nerve.

111
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:26,730
By the way, Miss Chu Li,

112
00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:28,770
that woman we brought back yesterday
is acting crazy again.

113
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:41,020
Let me out!

114
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:42,730
Let me out!

115
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:44,530
Let me out!

116
00:05:45,850 --> 00:05:47,020
Let me out!

117
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:50,970
What are you shouting for?

118
00:05:52,290 --> 00:05:53,309
Didn't I already tell you

119
00:05:53,351 --> 00:05:54,730
how to find that demon?

120
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:56,260
Let me go.

121
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:57,290
Please?

122
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:58,460
No.

123
00:05:59,210 --> 00:06:00,389
If that demon doesn't find

124
00:06:00,431 --> 00:06:01,620
a new body to latch onto,

125
00:06:01,970 --> 00:06:03,170
she'll come for you again.

126
00:06:03,820 --> 00:06:05,410
You can find her, right?

127
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:06,900
Go find her.

128
00:06:07,330 --> 00:06:08,290
Just let me go,

129
00:06:08,770 --> 00:06:09,620
will you?

130
00:06:11,210 --> 00:06:12,730
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

131
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:14,060
What are you up to?

132
00:06:14,900 --> 00:06:15,530
I...

133
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,580
I...

134
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:20,210
If you don't tell me,

135
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:21,730
I won't let you go.

136
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:33,700
Stop there.

137
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:36,380
Why are you avoiding me?

138
00:06:40,170 --> 00:06:41,330
I came to see the prisoner.

139
00:06:41,970 --> 00:06:43,140
Since you can handle it,

140
00:06:43,770 --> 00:06:45,500
you clearly don't need me here.

141
00:06:46,060 --> 00:06:47,020
Of course I do.

142
00:06:48,330 --> 00:06:49,410
I'm injured.

143
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,650
I can't do this alone.

144
00:06:54,210 --> 00:06:55,140
Miss Chu Li,

145
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:58,500
I'll tell you.

146
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:05,170
I want to go

147
00:07:07,770 --> 00:07:09,020
see someone.

148
00:07:41,530 --> 00:07:42,260
Qin Lang,

149
00:07:42,770 --> 00:07:44,260
I was held up yesterday

150
00:07:44,410 --> 00:07:45,330
and couldn't come see you.

151
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:47,170
You don't blame me, do you?

152
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:53,530
Qin Lang and I

153
00:07:54,290 --> 00:07:55,770
met at Huancai Pavilion.

154
00:07:57,460 --> 00:07:58,530
I was a singer.

155
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:00,700
He was a musician.

156
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:07,020
Qin Lang and I grew close.

157
00:08:07,650 --> 00:08:08,410
We fell in love.

158
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,580
We planned to save enough money

159
00:08:10,850 --> 00:08:12,580
to leave Huancai Pavilion

160
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:14,380
and then

161
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:16,330
spend our lives together.

162
00:08:17,770 --> 00:08:18,900
Unfortunately,

163
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:20,940
five months ago,

164
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:24,140
a drunk customer tried
to force himself on me.

165
00:08:25,410 --> 00:08:27,090
Qin Lang risked his life to protect me.

166
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,580
He managed to survive,

167
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:32,290
but he never woke up again.

168
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:35,170
You think

169
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:37,140
I made a deal with that demon

170
00:08:37,650 --> 00:08:39,530
to look beautiful,

171
00:08:40,170 --> 00:08:40,900
don't you?

172
00:08:48,170 --> 00:08:49,340
Beauty was never

173
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:51,220
what I wanted.

174
00:08:52,050 --> 00:08:53,220
I only wish

175
00:08:55,530 --> 00:08:57,260
Qin Lang could wake up.

176
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:01,960
(One Month Ago)

177
00:09:03,050 --> 00:09:04,410
What is your wish?

178
00:09:04,690 --> 00:09:05,290
I...

179
00:09:06,650 --> 00:09:07,980
I want Qin Lang

180
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,050
to wake up.

181
00:09:10,810 --> 00:09:11,930
Not for yourself,

182
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:14,860
but for a man?

183
00:09:16,530 --> 00:09:17,860
How foolish.

184
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:19,380
I beg you.

185
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:22,290
Qin Lang ended up like this
trying to save me.

186
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:24,740
I just want him to wake up.

187
00:09:25,050 --> 00:09:25,900
Very well.

188
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:28,620
Then bring me ten men

189
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,100
so I can drain their blood essence.

190
00:09:31,860 --> 00:09:32,570
That way,

191
00:09:33,450 --> 00:09:35,260
you can save your Qin Lang.

192
00:09:36,050 --> 00:09:37,530
I don't want to harm anyone.

193
00:09:39,650 --> 00:09:40,770
In this world,

194
00:09:41,450 --> 00:09:43,450
there are plenty of faithless men.

195
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:45,410
Why not

196
00:09:46,650 --> 00:09:48,050
take their lives?

197
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,530
It's a small price to pay

198
00:09:52,450 --> 00:09:53,770
to save your Qin Lang.

199
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:55,770
However,

200
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:58,220
if you can't get me ten men,

201
00:09:59,530 --> 00:10:01,570
you'll have to take their place.

202
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:12,980
You will

203
00:10:14,220 --> 00:10:16,260
get what you desire.

204
00:10:18,450 --> 00:10:19,770
I didn't want to harm anyone,

205
00:10:20,290 --> 00:10:22,020
so I kept putting it off.

206
00:10:22,740 --> 00:10:23,959
That ghost drained my vital essence

207
00:10:24,001 --> 00:10:25,380
day after day.

208
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:27,650
My hair grew longer and longer.

209
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:30,100
And I looked older and older.

210
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:31,690
I'm so scared.

211
00:10:32,410 --> 00:10:34,530
I'm so afraid that if Qin Lang wakes up

212
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:38,690
and sees me like this,

213
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:44,980
it'll break his heart.

214
00:10:48,930 --> 00:10:50,380
If only I could just

215
00:10:50,690 --> 00:10:52,340
grow old together with Qin Lang.

216
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:55,170
How wonderful that would be.

217
00:11:03,340 --> 00:11:04,260
Miss Chu Li,

218
00:11:04,450 --> 00:11:05,500
you're a shamaness.

219
00:11:05,690 --> 00:11:07,260
You must have a way to save him,

220
00:11:07,530 --> 00:11:08,290
right?

221
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:12,050
Even if it costs my life

222
00:11:12,530 --> 00:11:13,650
to save his...

223
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:15,530
You...

224
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:18,530
But if that happens,

225
00:11:19,450 --> 00:11:20,140
you...

226
00:11:20,290 --> 00:11:21,980
you must never tell him.

227
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:23,740
Just say...

228
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:26,740
Just say I've left Jinan City.

229
00:11:30,810 --> 00:11:32,380
Tell him to live well.

230
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:35,140
I beg you.

231
00:11:35,410 --> 00:11:37,020
Please, help me, Miss Chu Li.

232
00:11:38,020 --> 00:11:38,860
Get up now.

233
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:42,450
Miss Xizhao,

234
00:11:43,500 --> 00:11:45,260
I need to find a way
to destroy that demon

235
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:47,980
before I can help you
save your Qin Lang.

236
00:11:52,340 --> 00:11:54,260
But what if she really has a way?

237
00:11:54,570 --> 00:11:55,770
She's lying to you.

238
00:11:56,620 --> 00:11:57,339
She's nothing

239
00:11:57,381 --> 00:11:59,050
but a demon
that feeds on human blood essence.

240
00:11:59,170 --> 00:12:00,570
Why would she help you?

241
00:12:01,620 --> 00:12:02,500
Miss Xizhao,

242
00:12:03,260 --> 00:12:04,650
stop clinging to this delusion.

243
00:12:22,810 --> 00:12:24,500
Last night, I also tried
combing my hair before the mirror,

244
00:12:24,810 --> 00:12:26,100
but nothing happened.

245
00:12:26,810 --> 00:12:27,690
Where did you

246
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:29,170
hear about this method?

247
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:33,290
Huayue told me.

248
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:35,170
Huayue?

249
00:12:35,810 --> 00:12:36,570
The one

250
00:12:36,740 --> 00:12:37,770
who died at the tavern?

251
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:42,290
A month ago,

252
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:44,740
Huayue's looks suddenly changed.

253
00:12:45,170 --> 00:12:47,050
Even her body became unnaturally soft.

254
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:49,620
But it didn't last.

255
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:51,290
Before long,

256
00:12:51,900 --> 00:12:53,620
her face aged rapidly,

257
00:12:53,810 --> 00:12:54,930
just like mine.

258
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:57,900
She was thrown out of Huancai Pavilion
by the owner.

259
00:12:58,340 --> 00:12:59,140
I suppose

260
00:12:59,650 --> 00:13:01,500
she too was bewitched by that demon.

261
00:13:02,410 --> 00:13:03,770
Besides combing before the mirror,

262
00:13:04,140 --> 00:13:05,620
was there anything else unusual?

263
00:13:18,140 --> 00:13:19,650
Before Huayue left,

264
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:21,860
she gave me this score
for "Farewell Song."

265
00:13:26,170 --> 00:13:27,100
This is the scent.

266
00:13:28,410 --> 00:13:29,260
So

267
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:31,900
the problem isn't the mirror.

268
00:13:32,690 --> 00:13:33,690
It's this bamboo slip.

269
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:37,980
Someone used shamanic arts
on this bamboo slip,

270
00:13:38,570 --> 00:13:40,620
causing the demon to appear
and harm people.

271
00:13:41,810 --> 00:13:42,650
But

272
00:13:43,140 --> 00:13:45,380
how did Huayue get this bamboo slip?

273
00:13:46,050 --> 00:13:47,500
Huayue told me

274
00:13:47,980 --> 00:13:48,860
she bought

275
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,599
this bamboo slip from a singer

276
00:13:50,641 --> 00:13:51,770
named Lanruo.

277
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:53,860
But Lanruo...

278
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:55,650
What about her?

279
00:13:56,290 --> 00:13:57,260
She seems to have

280
00:13:58,410 --> 00:13:59,380
entered the palace.

281
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:08,290
Let's find a way

282
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:09,930
to deal with that demon first.

283
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:46,050
Black hair twines around bone,

284
00:14:46,500 --> 00:14:47,740
night dew cold.

285
00:14:50,620 --> 00:14:52,380
Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes,

286
00:14:53,260 --> 00:14:54,450
shines on the sleepless.

287
00:14:55,810 --> 00:14:57,930
White-hair curse turns to snow,

288
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:01,100
covering the realm.

289
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:31,470
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

290
00:15:33,090 --> 00:15:38,550
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

291
00:15:40,170 --> 00:15:43,400
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

292
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:46,880
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

293
00:15:47,010 --> 00:15:52,790
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

294
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:59,470
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

295
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:07,520
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

296
00:16:07,770 --> 00:16:11,280
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

297
00:16:11,330 --> 00:16:14,619
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

298
00:16:14,661 --> 00:16:21,600
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

299
00:16:21,850 --> 00:16:25,160
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

300
00:16:25,490 --> 00:16:29,400
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

301
00:16:29,450 --> 00:16:35,760
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

302
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:11,619
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

303
00:17:11,661 --> 00:17:17,840
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
